          "name": "Health Notify",
          "notes": "Notify characteristic for receiving health data from the device. Health data arrives as multiple 20-byte notification packets. Sub-command keys indicate data type:\n  0x07 = heart rate details today\n  0x08 = heart rate details history\n  0x03 = sports details today\n  0x04 = sleep details today\n  0x05 = sports details history\n  0x06 = sleep details history\n  0xee = data send finished\n  0xff = error\n\nReal-time data (from GetInfoCmd KEY_REAL_TIME, 0xA0): returns 12 bytes of data containing total_step, total_calories, total_distances, total_active_time, and heart_rate. Exact field widths and byte layout TBD — HCI snoop needed.\n",
          "properties": [
            "notify"
          ],
          "uuid": "00000af2-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb"
        }
      ],
